Z||000002||MikeSchaefer||10-05-2000||12:42 AM||||Hi, I got my old set from the focoa about 3 years ago, but they no longer sell them.  <BR>There is only one guaranteed source for them <BR>(Super-X <A HREF="http://users.supernet.com/superx/gauges/welcome.html" TARGET=_blank>http://users.supernet.com/superx/gauges/welcome.html</A>  , although they aren't listed on their web-site, you have to e-mail them).  But they run about $150 for 4 1/2", which is rediculous.  I have heard from Tom that he might make some in the future (http://www.fieroproject.com/tom) and Steven Kelley is making some really promising sounding aluminum stands.  His e-mail is: Steve_Kelley@hhs.dresden.k12.nh.us<BR>Just tell him to keep you informed, he loves hearing from people.<BR>They seem like such an easy product to offer, it is kind of weird how no-one does.  <BR>Hope this helped,<BR>Michael Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> ||||reg||1
